exports[`fixed report > renders stable markdown 1`] = `
"## Sutura — Surgical Report

**PATCH CERTIFIED** · <code>acme/checkout</code> · case <code>run-fixed-042</code>

### Diagnosis

**build** · 96% confidence

Failing command: <code>pnpm build</code>

- TS2307 in src/cart.ts
- package export changed in v4

> Cannot find module '@acme/money/format'

**Grounding**
- [Money v4 migration guide](<https://docs.example.test/money-v4>) — format moved to the package root in v4

### Triage

**Reproduced 5/5 across forked sandbox states — real.**

### Procedure

| Candidate | Strategy | Held? | Note |
| --- | --- | :---: | --- |
| candidate-a | Import format from the supported package root | YES | Survived the verification race |
| candidate-b | Pin the dependency to the previous major | NO | Rolled back; verification exited 1 |
| candidate-c | Add a local compatibility shim | NO | Rolled back; verification exited 1 |

### Pathology

**PASS** — adversarial verdict

| Check | Result | Evidence |
| --- | :---: | --- |
| deleted-test | **PASS** | No test files deleted |
| skipped-test | **PASS** | No skip or only markers added |
| weakened-assertion | **PASS** | Assertion count held at 42 |
| loosened-type | **PASS** | Compiler strictness unchanged |
| relaxed-config | **PASS** | CI configuration unchanged |
| pass-with-no-tests | **PASS** | No bypass flags added |
| llm-adjudication | **PASS** | The patch changes the unsupported import only |

> APPROVED: the survivor restores the supported API without reducing coverage or enforcement.

### Discharge

**Diff summary:** candidate-a: +1 / −1 lines

**Human merge check:** Confirm the surviving diff matches the diagnosed API change, then merge only if the cited checks remain green.

**Inference cost: $0.0121**

---

Models — Diagnosis: <code>nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B</code> · Procedure: <code>nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b</code> · Pathology: <code>nvidia/Nemotron-3-Ultra-550b-a55b</code>

[Open case-file artifact](<https://github.com/acme/repo/actions/runs/42/artifacts/7>)
"
`;

