**FLAKY — NO PATCH** · <code>acme/notifications</code> · case <code>run-flaky-017</code>

### Diagnosis

**flaky-timing** · 89% confidence

Failing command: <code>pnpm test -- notifications</code>

- timeout after 5000 ms
- same SHA passed on retry

> Timed out waiting for delivery receipt

### Triage

**Reproduced 0/5 across forked sandbox states — flaky. No patch proposed.**

---

Models — Diagnosis: <code>nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B</code>

